<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, yii bhɔɔba pɛ daa Timote</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timote yii Bɔɔba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Bhɔɔba, pɛ daa Timote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, yii bhɔɔba pɛ daa Timote</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote Bɔɔba</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mɛ mɛmbá nakyeeda nɛ Timote ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ lwomel e mɛsik mɛ mot-lwoma Pɔl, nyɛy e membok (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:9">2.9</ref></char>), ye nabɛ ɛ́ mbula bot nabet nyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:15">1.15</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-16">4.10-16</ref></char>). Eghɛŋ tak, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ eezenaagu náá, nyɛ moo aagwyɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:6">4.6</ref></char>). Nyɛ naamwana nɛ Timote mot nadi egyee nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛsa ɔ, mot nyɛ nadi ekwyɛl dáa mɔn ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak kaadaa ɛ tsik ɛ Pɔl: étɛp mɛsa mɛ dáa mot lwoma, mɛlyo mɛ, mezuk mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Pɔl ɛpedjɛ mɛlyo nɛ Timote. Nyɛ ɛpedjɛ nyɛ mɛghaaz náá, nyɛ waaboma nɛ mezuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa mɛ Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Bhii tak, nyɛ ɛpebaalɛɛ náá, nyɛ goola ɛnyɔɛpe mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:15">2.14—4.15</ref></char>). Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Timote goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkaab ɛni tɔ bɛ mɛwɔ, ɛlum koŋ nɛ bot ɛ mesyem, ɛbaŋa mɛfulu mɛ Pɔl. Ɛsok nɛ etɛp djas, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi sosoob nɛ mɛlyo mɛ Pɔl nɛ yii bɛdhiiti bɛlyoel ekeletyɛ nalyo nyɛ ɛ́.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhis eboo bɛtyaasɛs ɛ Yezu aagwyɛ ɛ́, bot ɛ nadjila bɛ e mɛsa mɛ etyaasɛs ɔ, nabaazokɛ ɛ dáa bɔɔ. Ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ, <char style="em">bɛ nabaal ɛnyɔɛpe mɛkpa</char> mɛ bɛ nagwak nɛ bɛlyoel bɔɔ ɛ. Tin, bɛ baagoka ɛ nɛ ɛlaa bɛmɛkana mɛ na Dɛɛ. Eghɛŋ Pɔl nakwyal Timote bɛmɛkana ɛ, e sok tak, bɛmɛkana mɛ tak nadi ɛ́, yii Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ Namwa, nɛghu ba bɛdhiiti bɔɔ epes mɛkana mɛ Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na Bes. Ekwyala bak djas ɛ «nɛ boo mɛtaŋ étɛp ɛlyo bot etsɛɛtsɛ, étɛp ɛsa náá bot myaal, étɛp ɛkoobal embee mɛsa mɔɔ, étɛp ɛsa náá mot di nɛ tsik epiki» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:16">3.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam, Pɔl mot-lwoma ɛ Yezu Klisto tɔ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb, mɛ ɛ́ wak ɛ étɛp ɛgoola bin tsik. Ye ɛ́ tsik Zɛɛb edjɛ mena kɔ ɛsu ɛgwakel ɛ lena nɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Mɛ kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ nɛ wɔy Timote mɔn'am mɛ di ekwyɛl ɔ: beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ, nɛ lyem ghoŋ, nɛ egwyem ɛ Zɛɛb sɛɛg bɛ nɛ Yezu Klisto di nɛ nɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpeghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Mɛ ɛpeghaapɛɛ Zɛɛb mot mɛ di esa mɛsa mɛ nɛ lyem wat dáa bɛbhaab'am nasa ɛ. Mwos nɛ pum e sok mɛ di edjaala Zɛɛb ɛ, mɛ nɛ dyeebadjaala étɛp'ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Mɛ ɛpetaala meŋal mɔ, e di'enek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛbee wɔ étɛp lyem'am neelwood nɛ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Mɛ ɛpebaataala dɔɔ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, wɔ zedum nɛ lyem wat ɛ. Ye ɛ́ kɔkɔ mbi ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb yii naye yɔ Loyis nɛ nyoog Enis nadi nɛ ye ɛ́. Mɛ eemyal náá, kɔkɔ mbi ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛlenek ɛ tɔ lɔ.<verse eid="2TI 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuka nɛ nam kɔ ɛsu ɛ mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Ye ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ baadi elɛɛ nɛ nɔ náá, baawyɛl mɛgoo mɛ ɛkɛɛ ɛ Zɛɛb nadjɛ wɔ ɛ, e sok mɛ nakɛl wɔ mɛmbɔ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Etɛɛ náá, Sisim Zɛɛb nadjɛ mena ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ etɛɛ náá mena di bɛtyak-bel, ye ɛ́ Sisim ghwyil, yii kwyɛl nɛ yii ɛdil ɛ lyem.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Sa wɔ ààdi nɛ syen ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka. Sa wɔ ààbaadi nɛ syen nɛ nam, mot di kwom kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɛ ɔ. Deenek, myaala ɛzuk sama nɛ nam étɛp Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Tin, dia nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ ghwyil Zɛɛb di edjɛ mena ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Nyɛy ɛ́ natsik mena, nɛ ɛsa náá mena dika bot ɛ́ dhaad mbyak'ɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ enɛm esa bena, ye nabɛ ɛ́ egeka bɛ met nɛ enɛm nɛ embee bɛ met. Tin, Zɛɛb naadjɛ mena enɛm nɛ embɛɛ binek e ze ɛ Yezu Klisto, ɛsok nɛ nyɛ nɛkus bhwak. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Tin, ɛkɛɛ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ tak kazɛnyen mos ɛ e ɛtuula ɛ mɛtsik-bot menaka Yezu Klisto. Nyɛy ɛ mot nakwak ɛsyee ɔ, dum nɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ nyɛ natel mena tsik na kɔm-kɔm. <verse eid="2TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Zɛɛb naadjɛ mɛ mɛsa mɛ ɛdi mot-lwoma nɛ lyoel, étɛp ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ, mɛ di ebee mezuk mɛ mɛ di ezuk'aak. Mɛ tok nɛ syen étɛp tak etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu mot mɛ wa ɛbwaalel ɛ lam nɛ nɔ ɛnyɔɛpe. Tin, mɛ ɛpemyaal náá, Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛbaal sa nyɛ nadjɛ mɛ ɛ kɛkum dwoo epɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Deenek, mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ wɔ nagwak nɛ nam ɛ, ye ɛ́ di mɛkpa mɛfulu mɛ tsik'ɔ. Tin, pyeta tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, kwyɛla bot nɛ kwyɛl di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Deenek, baala mbɛɛ mɛlyo djas nazedjɛaa wɔ nɛ ghwyil Sisim na Dɛɛ di tɔ lena ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esosoob ɛ Onezifɔɔd nɛ yii bot ɛ mɛbyel mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Wɔ nɛ gu náá bot ɛ kyee dik Azi djas naazekaab mɛ, tɔ sama bot ɛ tak, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ Fizɛl bɛ nɛ Elmozɛn. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa enɛm esa bɛ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Onezifɔɔd, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ naadyeebadjɛ mɛ mɛghaaz. Tin, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààgwak syen nɛ nam, mam mot membok. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Deenek, dáa nyɛ tuula tɔ ghaada Lɔm ɛ, nyɛ naawa zii e ɛsaa mɛ, kɛbela mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Tin, beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa enɛm esa e Zɛɛb nɛ nɛ dwoo epɛɛ. Wɔy ɛmet nɛ baagu ɛnyɔɛpe esa djas nyɛ nasa nɛ nam pɛ kyee dik Efɛɛz ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo dum nɛ dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛdi mbɛɛ sodja ɛ Klisto ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Wɔy, mɔn'am, dia nɛ ghwyil tɔ enɛm nɛ embɛɛ di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Mɛlyo mɛ wɔ nadi egwak mɛ egoola e mis mɛ bɛtɛ nɛ bɛtyaasɛs ɛ. Deenek, lyoa yɛ nɛ bɛtɛtɛ ɛ bot, bot aadi nɛ ghwyil ɛ aabaalyo bɛdhiiti bot ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Zuka nɛ nam dhatyee tɛtɛ sodja ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Mot di náá, nyɛ dinaa kuku ɛsa mɛsa mɛ esodja ɔ, nyɛ kwyɛl náá, kukuma yɛ myaala nɛ nɛ ɔ, sa nyɛ ààbaasa dhiiti mɛsa mɛ sis. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Ye ɛ́ tyee wat mot di esa mɛbhoola tɔ mɛsɛŋ mɛ ɛwyis ɛ kaab ɔ. Nyɛ aabela efute ɛ, nyɛ sa dáa mɛtiŋ mɛ mɛbhoola mɛ tak di elɛɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Beeka mbɛel mɛbhek di ezuk ɛlyelɛpe tɔ mɛsa mɛ pyeeb'ɛ ɔ. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi mot mɛkɛn aadɛ esa nyɛ nabɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Simza ɛnyɔɛpe sa mɛ di elɛɛ wɔ ɛ, deenek, Ghɛŋ ɛwaasa náá wɔ mɛt etɛp djas.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taala Yezu Klisto mot nagom ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Taala nɛ Yezu Klisto, dha ɛ Dhavid mot nagom bhis ɛsyee ɔ, dáa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di egoola ɛ di elɛɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Ye ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal'ak ɛ mɛ di ezuk, kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak ɛ mɛ di kɔɔla, dáa mot di esa embee étɛp ɔ. Tin, mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb tok kɔɔla! <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Etɛp tak ɛ mɛ di emaad etɛp djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛɛ ɔ. Mɛ sa deenek ɛ etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ Zɛɛb nazesɛɛ ɔ, neebela tsik nɛ duu na kɔm-kɔm di edus pɛ daa Yezu Klisto ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ye ɛ́ mbɛɛ mɛ mɛkpa mɛ etsɛɛtsɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Mena gwyɛka sama wat nɛ Klisto ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">mena waadika nɛ tsik sama wat nɛ nɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Mena pyetka ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">mena waakɛ sama nɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Mena byenka nyɛ ɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">nyɛy pe aabyen mena.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Mena di ààdika sosoob ɔɔ, nyɛy ɛ́ aazodiɛ sosoob,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">etɛɛ náá, nyɛy tok nɛ ghwyil ɛswonal mɛkpa mɛ nuub'ɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 23:19">Ɛla 23.19</ref>.</char></note>.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mot-mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Baagheelelɛɛ etɛp bak nɛ bot, dula bɛ mɛlo e mis ɛ Zɛɛb náá, sa bɛ ààsuu mɛso kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkpa. Ɛsuu mɛso menek ɛ ààval sa wat, mbi yenek e saŋ ɛ ɛsaab esisim e bot ɛ di egwak ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Saŋa náá, wɔ di piki e mis ɛ Zɛɛb, dáa mot-mɛsa di ààbɛ nɛ syen e ɛgoola ɛnyɔɛpe Mbɛɛ Bhaadal etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Kyeea mbee melɛŋ di ebyasal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ, etɛɛ náá, bot ɛ di esa deenek ɔ ɛpebɛka nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mɛlyo mɔɔ ɛ ɛpebel epuud dáa pyoŋ zeni ɛgwyin ɛ. Tin, ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Imenus nɛ Filɛtus, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>bɛ naazebɛka nɛ etsɛɛtsɛ. Bot binɔk eezepul ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb e bɛdhiiti bot, elyo bot ɛ náá, Zɛɛb naazeghomal bot tɔ ɛsyee.<verse eid="2TI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Bela náá epap nalyeelyel ee Zɛɛb nasum ɛ ɛpepyet ɛnyɔɛpe, mɛkpa mak ɛ kwyala kɔ tak: «Ghɛŋ nɛ gu bɔn bɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:5">Ɛla 16.5</ref>.</char></note>», é di'enek, «Mot di eke náá, nyɛ ɛ́ mot ɛ Ghɛŋ ɔ, nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛliig koŋ nɛ ɛbiyo.»<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Tɔ boo ndjaa, ye ɛ́ aanàkwaazodi vɛ esaani e lɔaad nɛ yii ghwooz di esaa nɛ epata ɛ toto. Yɛ aabaadiɛ nɛ yii kpaka dɔɔ nɛ yii dyak. Bɛdhiiti kwomaa ɛ étɛp mɛbyoŋ, bɛdhiiti étɛp ɛbeaa mɛlu djas. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Tin, mot ɛdis edhuud e mbee mɛsa mɛ etɛp binek djas ɔɔ. Mot tak ɛ aadi ɛ́ dáa esaani goŋ di ebeea dwoo mɛbyoŋ ɛ. Nyɛ eezeso nyel ɛ djas e mɛsa mɛ kukuma yɛ, e di'enek, nyɛ moo ɛ́ mbɛɛ mot, nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkasa tɛtɛ esesɛɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Timote kyeea mbee egwyes e ngbaaz, kɛa tɔ epiki, nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl, nɛ egwyem nɛ bot ɛ di eduwal Ghɛŋ nɛ lyem wat ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Tin, sa wɔ ààsuu mɛso nɛ etɛp di ààbɛ nɛ lo mɛsɔ ɛ, etɛɛ náá wɔ nɛ gu náá, ɛdjóo ɛ mɛwɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>E di'enek, kwom mot-mɛsa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ ààgoka nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛwɔ. Nyɛ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ kwyɛl nɛ bot djas, nɛ ghwyil ɛlyo bot, nɛ ɛmaad ɛ lyem. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Ye goka ɛ́ náá, nyɛ lyo bot ɛ mɛso tɔ mɛtela, nɛghu Zɛɛb ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ bɛ ɛwala dinaa bɛ waaswoola mɛfulu mɔɔ da gu etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Deenek, bɛ waabula tɔ mbɛɛ mɛfulu mɔɔ, da bɛ dus e laab ɛ Satan mot mɛkɔŋ, mot nazewa bɛ e membok étɛp bɛ neesesa mɛsa mɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mezuk mɛ mɛlu mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Gua ɛnyɔɛpe náá: e mɛlu mɛ mɛsik, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛlu mɛ di elyel ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Etɛɛ náá, bot aanàkagwyena, bot aakadi ɛ́ elyem «tɔɔp» tɔ epata, bot ɛghɛɛa nyel, bot ɛ ɛbet, bot ɛ waabyasal Zɛɛb, bɛ aanàkaab bɛbyael bɔɔ, bot ɛ di ààmyaal bot nɛ ɛduwal etɛp dinaa ye ɛ́ e Zɛɛb ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Bot ɛ tak aadi ɛ́, ààbɛ nɛ lyem kwyɛl, ààbɛ nɛ lyem ghoŋ, bot ɛ mɛbhekel, bot ɛ di ekwyɛ lyem ɔ, bot ɛ di nɛ lyem kyet ɔ, bot ɛ di ààkwyɛl enɛm esa. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Bot ɛ endumta, bot ɛ di ebiyo mbɛs ɔ, bot ɛ ɛghɛɛa nyel, bɛ waakwyɛl mɛnyɔ mɛ etɛp e bɔs dhaa yii Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Bot binɔk sa tyee náá, bɛ ɛpedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. Ghuna ye ɛ́ bot ɛ di ààmyaal ghwyil di tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ! E di'enek, dia ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ mbi binɔk bot.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ ɛ nɛ mɛfulu mɛ ɛni tɔ mendjaa mɛ bot étɛp ɛkɔɔ boa di ààbɛ nɛ etsoŋ ɔ. Bɛ sa deenek ɛ étɛp boa tak neegwak bɛ. Boa tak ɛ, boa di àànyɔ ɛtiibal ɔ, boa ɛ di tɔ tsik mesyem ɔ, bɛ nɛ dyeebakwyɛl esa e tsik epuud di ekwyɛl ɛ djas. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Mɛlu djas, boa tak ɛ ɛpesaa ɛgu sonok, tin, bɛ aanàkwaakogu etsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ye ɛ́ dáa bot tyee Zanɛs nɛ Zambɛlɛs nadi ebyen étɛp ɛ Moiiz ɛ, ye ɛ́ deenek ɛ bot binɔk di ebaabyen etɛp etsɛɛtsɛ. Ye ɛ́ bot ɛ mbee mɛpek dinaa ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb tokapɛ vaŋ sonok e mis mɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Tin, bɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛtɔ́ nɛ ye ɛtsetaɛpe, etɛɛ náá, bot djas ɛ waagu ewo bɔɔ, dáa yɛ Zanɛs nɛ Zambɛlɛs.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy Timote ɔ, wɔ bɛ ɛ́ wɔ eegwak mɛlyo mam ɛnyɔɛpe, tɔ mɛfulu mam, tɔ mɛsa mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ sa ɛ, tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lam nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛmaad ɛ lyem'am, tɔ kwyɛl'am, nɛ tɔ zii'am, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>tɔ mɛtiiga mɛ bɛ di etiig mɛ ɛ, tɔ mezuk mam. Wɔ nɛ gu etɛp djas mɛ naboma nɛ yɛ pɛ ghaada Antiɔs ɛ, pɛ tɔ ghaada Ikoniɔm nɛ pɛ tɔ ghaada Listɛ ɛ. Wɔ nɛ gu mezuk mɛ mɛ naboma nɛ ye ɛ́. Tin, Ghɛŋ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ naapɛk mɛ tɔ etɛp binek djas. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Tsɛɛtsɛ, mot djas di ekwyɛl ɛdi sosoob nɛ Zɛɛb, tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ, nyɛ waatiigaa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Tin, bot ɛ mbee lyem nɛ bot ɛ etsal, bɛ waatɔ́ sok tɔ embee mɛsa mɔɔ, bɛ waakɔɔ bɔɔ bɛsɔ bɔɔ. E di'enek, e mɛsik mɛ tak, bɛ waaswala kɔɔ mɛnyel mɔɔ met. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, baala mɛdjek mɛ wɔ nadjek, da wɔ myaal nɛ lyem wat ɛ. Wɔ nɛ gu bɛlyoel wɔ nadjek pɛ daa lɔɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Kana edhɔma bɔ, wɔ nɛ gu ekwyala na Dɛɛ. Ye ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛdjɛ wɔ etsoŋ di edjɛ mot tsik tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Tɔ ekwyala bɛ na Dɛɛ djas, ye ɛ́ Zɛɛb ɛ nadjɛ bot etsoŋ e ɛkwyal ɛ yɛ, ye ɛ́ nɛ boo mɛtaŋ étɛp ɛlyo bot etsɛɛtsɛ. Étɛp ɛlyaal ɛ mot ɛdjak ɛ lɛ, nɛ ɛbulal ɛ bot sa ɛbiyo ɔ e ze, dɔɔ nɛ ɛlyaal ɛ mot tsik Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>Ekwyala na Dɛɛ binek ɛ, nakwyalaa ɛ etɛɛ mot-mɛsa ɛ Zɛɛb needi mot zedjala nɛ ɛsa ɛ mɛsa ɔ. Nyɛ needi mot dinaa, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa membi mɛ enɛm esa djas.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ, é mis mɛ Zɛɛb nɛ é mis mɛ Yezu Klisto mot aapɛ́ɛ bot ɛ di nɛ tsik, nɛ bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nɔ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbula ɛ Yezu Klisto, nɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ: <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>wa zii tɔ ɛgoola mɛkpa mɛ Zɛɛb ye nakoozodi tɔ egwyem nɛghu tɔ ɛtap. Lyaka bɛ, dula bɛ mɛlɔ, é ghɛŋ wɔ di djɛ bɛ mɛghaaz ɛ, nɛ ɛlyo bɛ tɔ ɛdil ɛ lyem. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Etɛɛ náá, yɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ ɛwala dinaa bot aanàbaakwyɛl ɛgwak mbɛɛ mɛlyo ɛ. Tin, bɛ aasa e mbi bɛmɛpek djas étɛp ɛsa esa e mɛkwosak mɛ mɛnyel mɔɔ di ekwyɛl ɛ. Bɛ aadi ɛ́, nɛ bɛtɛ nɛ embee bɛlyoel aadi elyo bɛ etɛp elyem bɔɔ di ekwos ɛgwak ɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>E di'enek, bɛ waabyen ɛgwak etsɛɛtsɛ, étɛp ɛdu ɛ esesa esua-sua. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Yɛ kabɛ wɔy ɔ, sa wɔ dila lyem sok bhwoob etɛp binek djas. Maada lyem tɔ mezuk, wa zii e ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, silela mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb djɛ wɔ ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Yɛ kabɛ mam ɔ, ɛwala eezedjala ghiya yam neesee dáa buwa, ɛwala ɛmwana nɛ bɔs'ak eezedjala. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ eeduu mbɛɛ tuub ɔɔ, mɛ eekɛkum pɛ ɛsik ɛ kaab mɛ na pat ɛ, mɛ eebaal ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Nenak, efute ɛpebwood mɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ eekwak. Efute tak ɛ kɔtɔ duu, ye ɛ́ kɔtɔ mot epiki. Ye ɛ́ nyɛy Ghɛŋ mbɛɛ tetɛp ɛ kwaadjɛ mɛ dwoo mɛpɛɛa ɛ. Tin, nyɛ aanàkwaadjɛ mam ɛmet, nyɛ aadjɛ ɛ dɔɔ nɛ bot djas di egwal ɛwala nyɛ aatuula ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ Pɔl pɛɛ dáa Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Tin, sa mɛghaaz etɛɛ náá, wɔ neeleezɛbela mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Dhemas naazekaab mɛ, etɛɛ náá lyem tɔ kwyɛl esa e bɔs'ak. Nyɛ eetɔ́ pɛ ghaada Tesalonik. Yɛ kabɛ Kelesɔn ɔ, nyɛ eetɔ́ pɛ ghaada Ghalati. Tit naazetɔ́ yɛ pɛ ghaada Dhalmati. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luk nyɛ ɛmet ɛ kalik bis nɛ nɛ. E sok wɔ aazyɛ ɛ́, dha bi nɛ Malak. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛ zɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Mɛ eelwom Tisik pɛ ghaada Efɛɛz. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>E sok wɔ waazyɛ ɛ́, da wɔ zyɛ mɛ nɛ ndjookuwa yam ee mɛ nalik pɛ ghaada Toloas pɛ tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ Kalpus ɛ. Tin, da wɔ baanɔɔ mɛ mɛkana mam, daŋ-daŋ ɛ mɛkana nasael nɛ eket bɛtit. <verse eid="2TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Deenek, Alɛkzandɛlɛ lulel egwooz nadyeebasa mɛ ɛbiyo. Tin, Ghɛŋ nyɛ ɛmet waadjɛ nyɛ efute mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Tin, wɔ goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛbaadi nɛ etsoŋ nɛ nɛ, etɛɛ náá nyɛ bɛ ɛ́ nyɛ dyeebasuu mɛso nɛ mɛlyo mɛ bis nadi elyo ɛ.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Tin, mot ngɔt nabɛ ɛ́ ààkɛm e sok mɛ nadi etaŋal taŋal yam yii mɛkɛn ɛ, bot djas nakaab mɛ. Beta náá, Zɛɛb nàlaa syem tak kɔ lɔɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Tin, Ghɛŋ nakwyee mɛ, nyɛ naadjɛ mɛ mɛghaaz! Wɔ gwaa, mɛ zɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal yɛ pɛ daa bot di ààbɛ tɔ dhaad mbyak eYuda ɔ. Ghɛŋ naapɛk tɔ nuub ghee. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Deenek, Ghɛŋ waabaapɛk mɛ tɔ embee etɛp djas. Tin, nyɛ aatsik mɛ ɛ étɛp nyɛ neeniigal mɛ tɔ ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ di tɔ gwoo ɛ. Beta náá, duu di nɛ nɛ kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! Ye di deenek!<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Da wɔ ɛ́ swos Pilisil bɛ nɛ Akilas dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ mɛbyel ɛ Onezifɔɔd. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elast eelik pɛ ghaada Koolɛt. Tin, mɛ eelik Tolofim pɛ ghaada Milɛ, etɛɛ náá nyel nadi ekpaa nyɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Deenek, sa mɛghaaz wɔ kum, ɛsok nɛ mbu bɛbhi nɛ kan. Ebulus, Pudɔɔ, Linus, Kolodya nɛ bɛdhiiti bɔn nyoog, bɛ eeswos wɔ. <verse eid="2TI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Beta náá, Ghɛŋ di nɛ nɔ. Beta náá enɛm nɛ embɛɛ e Zɛɛb di nɛ nen.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
